  [2mctrl + g to edit in $EDITOR             ↑ ↓ to pick a completion               ↑ ↓ j k ← → to move or change a value[0m
  [2mctrl + v to paste an image              tab to complete a command              enter to pick the highlighted choice[0m
  [2malt + ← → to move by word               tab enter to add a file or agent       esc to reject a permission[0m
